Stardew Valley game art
-----------------------
Stardew Valley, its name, and all of its art (including the sprites and farm
map images in public/assets/sprites, public/assets/layouts and
public/assets/game) are © ConcernedApe LLC. They are used here, unmodified
apart from cropping and assembling map tiles, for non-commercial fan purposes
only, and are not covered by this project's code license. If ConcernedApe
asks, they will be removed.

- public/assets/sprites and the interior images in public/assets/layouts:
  copied from the v2 Stardew Valley planner repository (see below), whose
  author extracted them from the game.
- The farm images in public/assets/layouts: rendered from the game's own map
  files by scripts/import-farms.mts.
- public/assets/game: cropped from the game's own content files by
  scripts/import-game.mts.

